<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.360" end="00:00:06.600" style="s2">Hello everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.040" end="00:00:11.519" style="s2">We had a a big night last night as you</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.679" end="00:00:13.920" style="s2">know. It was a very successful night. I</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.519" end="00:00:16.320" style="s2">think we carried some people across the</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.920" end="00:00:18.160" style="s2">finish line. We&#39;ll see. But that was</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.320" end="00:00:21.600" style="s2">great in Iowa. Now I&#39;m going to Florida</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.160" end="00:00:23.359" style="s2">Fort Myers and we&#39;ll uh I think have a</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.600" end="00:00:25.519" style="s2">we have a tremendous crowd. I can tell</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.359" end="00:00:27.279" style="s2">you they&#39;re lined up miles long, but</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.519" end="00:00:30.000" style="s2">we&#39;ll be there soon. Hi, Steve.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.279" end="00:00:32.880" style="s2">President Trump. The ceasefire is really</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.000" end="00:00:35.120" style="s2">good news. Will the first lady be a part</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.880" end="00:00:36.640" style="s2">of the trilateral peace talks that</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.120" end="00:00:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but it&#39;s not the worst idea I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.640" end="00:00:38.399" style="s2">ever heard.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.120" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.399" end="00:00:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What she wants to do is save children</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.800" end="00:00:46.559" style="s2">and that&#39;s her focus and both sides are</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.160" end="00:00:46.879" style="s2">cooperating with her. So doing a very</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.559" end="00:00:48.079" style="s2">good job.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.879" end="00:00:51.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did that all come about, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.079" end="00:00:53.520" style="s2">President? Uh her initiative and uh they</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.440" end="00:00:56.640" style="s2">contacted both sides and both sides</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.520" end="00:00:58.559" style="s2">wanted to do it. Is there any news now?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.640" end="00:01:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any news on a new press secretary that</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.559" end="00:01:02.000" style="s2">you can give us a new press secretary?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.160" end="00:01:03.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, nothing. We&#39;re in no Russia.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.000" end="00:01:07.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President, you look out that says</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.680" end="00:01:08.479" style="s2">Jared Kushner had access to $2 billion</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.040" end="00:01:09.680" style="s2">from Middle Eastern countries.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.479" end="00:01:10.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a false story.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.680" end="00:01:11.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a false story. You don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.960" end="00:01:14.560" style="s2">anything about that?</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.680" end="00:01:16.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s a totally false story. Totally</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.560" end="00:01:17.680" style="s2">an incorrect story. It was just fake</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.400" end="00:01:20.159" style="s2">news. It&#39;s amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.680" end="00:01:22.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President, you must know now who</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.159" end="00:01:24.720" style="s2">ordered the Starling access in Ukraine</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.640" end="00:01:26.240" style="s2">to be restricted. Was it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.720" end="00:01:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, well, I wouldn&#39;t tell you if I</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.240" end="00:01:29.119" style="s2">didn&#39;t know. I have no idea. But I</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.840" end="00:01:31.280" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t tell you if I did know. Why</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.119" end="00:01:33.119" style="s2">would I tell you who you is?</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.280" end="00:01:35.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a CNN sir.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.119" end="00:01:40.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I tell CNN? Although they did</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.680" end="00:01:40.280" style="s2">do some nice polls on me, I&#39;m not saying</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.400" end="00:01:46.159" style="s2">those polls. I like them more said</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.320" end="00:01:48.799" style="s2">access.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.159" end="00:01:51.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If there is a problem, I&#39;ll get 20,000</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.799" end="00:01:51.799" style="s2">non,000</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.320" end="00:01:56.560" style="s2">non. Well, I&#39;m not surprised. It could</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.240" end="00:01:58.799" style="s2">be hundreds of thousand. That was just a</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.560" end="00:02:01.280" style="s2">batch. 20,000</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.799" end="00:02:04.240" style="s2">absolutely fraudulent in California for</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.280" end="00:02:07.040" style="s2">voting. And it could be a 100,000. It</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.240" end="00:02:09.440" style="s2">could be 3, 4, 500,000.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.040" end="00:02:14.480" style="s2">California is very corrupt in voting. So</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.440" end="00:02:16.800" style="s2">is Minnesota. So are many other states.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.480" end="00:02:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Early voting. Early voting is at record</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.800" end="00:02:21.120" style="s2">levels in a number of states that are</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.720" end="00:02:23.920" style="s2">critical for Republicans to hold on to</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.120" end="00:02:25.440" style="s2">the Senate. Texas, Ohio, North Carolina.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.920" end="00:02:25.599" style="s2">Who do you think that early voting is</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.440" end="00:02:27.200" style="s2">going?</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.599" end="00:02:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, nobody knows. I mean, we&#39;ll find</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.200" end="00:02:32.400" style="s2">out. I I think that we&#39;re doing very</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.599" end="00:02:33.920" style="s2">well against Telico. I think we&#39;re doing</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.400" end="00:02:35.760" style="s2">very well. We have the best attorney</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.920" end="00:02:37.519" style="s2">general in the history of Texas running.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.760" end="00:02:39.440" style="s2">So, I think we&#39;re doing well, but we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.519" end="00:02:42.160" style="s2">going to find out. The numbers are very</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.440" end="00:02:44.160" style="s2">high all over the numbers in like I was</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.160" end="00:02:45.920" style="s2">in Iowa. I saw the enthusiasm last</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.160" end="00:02:48.319" style="s2">night. I think there&#39;s great Republican</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.920" end="00:02:51.280" style="s2">enthusiasm. I really think, you know, I</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.319" end="00:02:53.200" style="s2">keep hearing about different things. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.280" end="00:02:55.040" style="s2">you&#39;ve been following me. I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.200" end="00:02:57.840" style="s2">you&#39;ve been packed. Every house every</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.040" end="00:03:00.640" style="s2">house is people that can&#39;t get in. Uh</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.840" end="00:03:02.319" style="s2">Fort Buyers, they that&#39;s Florida. They</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.640" end="00:03:04.800" style="s2">say they&#39;ve never seen anything like it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.319" end="00:03:08.599" style="s2">So, I mean, if that if that counts, I</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.800" end="00:03:08.599" style="s2">think we&#39;re doing very well.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.680" end="00:03:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have not spoken with them.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.760" end="00:03:18.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I might I might have to, but I have not.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.640" end="00:03:21.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard I&#39;ve heard it was fixed, but</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.640" end="00:03:23.440" style="s2">if it&#39;s not, I I&#39;ll stick a message to</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.519" end="00:03:25.280" style="s2">the minority voters that supported you</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.440" end="00:03:26.640" style="s2">so much now that we&#39;re in the midst of</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.280" end="00:03:27.120" style="s2">any message to minority and black</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.640" end="00:03:28.720" style="s2">voters.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.120" end="00:03:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think the minority voters been great</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.720" end="00:03:32.640" style="s2">to me, you know. So, I&#39;ve been great to</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.040" end="00:03:36.159" style="s2">the minority voter. Look what I&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.640" end="00:03:38.480" style="s2">for for uh as an example with the</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.159" end="00:03:40.959" style="s2">historically black colleges and</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.480" end="00:03:42.720" style="s2">universities. I&#39;ve taken care of them.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.959" end="00:03:45.040" style="s2">I&#39;ve I&#39;ve been very good to Hispanic</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.720" end="00:03:46.560" style="s2">voters been great to me, but I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.040" end="00:03:48.319" style="s2">great to them, too. You know, there&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.560" end="00:03:50.239" style="s2">reason. And I&#39;ve been great to</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.319" end="00:03:52.000" style="s2">Hispanics. That&#39;d be great to blacks.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.239" end="00:03:53.680" style="s2">That&#39;d be great to pretty much</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.000" end="00:03:56.159" style="s2">everywhere. It&#39;s a different Republican</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.680" end="00:03:58.799" style="s2">party, but we&#39;re also the the party of</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.159" end="00:04:00.239" style="s2">the worker. It&#39;s a much bigger party</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.799" end="00:04:02.720" style="s2">than it used to be. I mean, if you go</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.239" end="00:04:05.200" style="s2">back 10 years ago before I got on the</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.720" end="00:04:07.439" style="s2">scene, it&#39;s a much more powerful party.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.200" end="00:04:09.920" style="s2">This is a much bigger, frankly, more</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.439" end="00:04:12.159" style="s2">important party. You&#39;ve been campaigning</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.920" end="00:04:14.480" style="s2">nonstop for the past few weeks. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.159" end="00:04:16.959" style="s2">campaign non-stop next week. Who do you</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.480" end="00:04:19.359" style="s2">view right now as the most vulnerable</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.959" end="00:04:21.919" style="s2">Republican Senate candidates?</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.359" end="00:04:23.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I wouldn&#39;t want to say that.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.919" end="00:04:25.360" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t want to say that, but there</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.919" end="00:04:26.800" style="s2">are a couple that are a little bit</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.360" end="00:04:28.960" style="s2">vulnerable. There are a couple where</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.800" end="00:04:30.479" style="s2">they had a little bad luck over the last</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.960" end="00:04:32.639" style="s2">couple of weeks. Something came out</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.479" end="00:04:37.840" style="s2">about But the Democrats have that done,</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.639" end="00:04:39.360" style="s2">too. I mean, look at you look at Elad in</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.840" end="00:04:41.759" style="s2">Michigan. You take a look at that. I</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.360" end="00:04:44.000" style="s2">mean, he&#39;s had more bad publicity, but</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.759" end="00:04:46.160" style="s2">you know, we&#39;ll see what happens. I do</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.000" end="00:04:48.400" style="s2">think that some of the networks give too</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.160" end="00:04:50.639" style="s2">much air time to the opponents, if you</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.400" end="00:04:52.880" style="s2">want to know that</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.639" end="00:04:55.440" style="s2">said on Iran, Mike said that there could</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.880" end="00:04:57.360" style="s2">be a stalemate for up to a year and the</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.440" end="00:04:58.880" style="s2">US is preparing for an extended</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.360" end="00:05:00.560" style="s2">conflict. But you keep saying it&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.880" end="00:05:02.880" style="s2">to</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.560" end="00:05:05.680" style="s2">we could end it very quickly, but Iran</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.880" end="00:05:07.360" style="s2">is a failing nation. We&#39;re taking all</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.680" end="00:05:09.759" style="s2">the oil out that we want. You see that</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.360" end="00:05:11.360" style="s2">with the homeown straight, our navy and</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.759" end="00:05:13.360" style="s2">we have it blocked up for them but</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.360" end="00:05:16.240" style="s2">nobody else and everybody is taking oil</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.360" end="00:05:18.560" style="s2">out. Uh in fact last week we took more</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.240" end="00:05:21.120" style="s2">oil out than we have ever taken it out</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.560" end="00:05:22.639" style="s2">even before the war. So that and that</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.120" end="00:05:25.199" style="s2">was a big that was the big sticking</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.639" end="00:05:27.440" style="s2">point. So we have that and they have</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.199" end="00:05:29.759" style="s2">inflation. They have no money that you</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.440" end="00:05:31.840" style="s2">know the question is do we want to</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.759" end="00:05:33.759" style="s2">finish it off or do we let it do we just</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.840" end="00:05:36.080" style="s2">want to let it wither because we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.759" end="00:05:38.160" style="s2">getting everything we want. received. We</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.080" end="00:05:40.639" style="s2">have more oil coming out of the Homo</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.160" end="00:05:42.800" style="s2">Straight today than they did a year ago.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.639" end="00:05:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Israel, do you think the vice president?</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.800" end="00:05:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to vote tomorrow. I think</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.800" end="00:05:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think we&#39;re voting tomorrow in</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.160" end="00:05:49.280" style="s2">Florida.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.720" end="00:05:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come doesn&#39;t have a gag order like</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.280" end="00:05:51.840" style="s2">How come Elon Morg doesn&#39;t have a gag</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.880" end="00:05:53.759" style="s2">order like you did?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.840" end="00:05:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I love that question.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.759" end="00:05:58.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love that question. She should have.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.440" end="00:06:01.199" style="s2">But look, what she did is her whole life</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.479" end="00:06:04.240" style="s2">is a scam as far as I&#39;m concerned.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.199" end="00:06:05.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her whole life is a total scam. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.240" end="00:06:08.479" style="s2">think your vice president JD Vance</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.919" end="00:06:08.880" style="s2">should have endorsed Netanyahu just like</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.479" end="00:06:10.479" style="s2">you did?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.880" end="00:06:11.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know that he did or did. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.479" end="00:06:13.199" style="s2">up to him. He didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.360" end="00:06:15.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would I would leave that up to him.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.199" end="00:06:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President, if there is if there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.280" end="00:06:18.160" style="s2">gridlock for the next two years,</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.960" end="00:06:20.240" style="s2">obviously you don&#39;t want to see that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.160" end="00:06:21.360" style="s2">But if there is, would that be bad for</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.240" end="00:06:23.199" style="s2">the US economy?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.360" end="00:06:26.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it would be probably good because</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.199" end="00:06:28.000" style="s2">we&#39;re taking a tremendous Don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.160" end="00:06:29.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; when you say gridlock, you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.000" end="00:06:29.440" style="s2">about Iran.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.039" end="00:06:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That would be</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.440" end="00:06:32.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m talking about gridlock in terms of</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.800" end="00:06:34.240" style="s2">your legislative agenda.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.319" end="00:06:35.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, gr that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.240" end="00:06:38.880" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk about gridlock with Iran.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.919" end="00:06:40.800" style="s2">Iran is not able to do much now and we</p>
